# Public keys official Nectar releases are signed with (cosign.pub, PEM). The panel verifies the image of
# every panel and gateway update against them before applying it (internal/update/cosign.go).
#
# Empty = updates are not verified. To turn verification on for the official builds:
#   cosign generate-key-pair            # keep cosign.key secret: repo secrets COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY, COSIGN_PASSWORD
#   paste cosign.pub below (several keys are fine: keep the old one while rotating)
# The same file must be used by nectar_apps and nectar_gateway releases (both are verified by the panel).
